WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Workers on an unfinished building guide a concrete cap hanging from a crane cable. They steady and align the piece by hand as it is lowered toward a masonry wall.

00:10.000 --> 00:26.000
The view widens to show the overhead cable, the workers and the surrounding structure. The workers continue guiding the suspended piece toward the top of the wall.
